WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
Sometimes, good events can change us.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:07.679
For example, someone might try a skateboard and become someone who loves excitement.

00:00:07.679 --> 00:00:12.040
These people might also like roller coasters or skydiving when they grow up.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.039
At the same time, other people might feel something different about skateboarding.

00:00:16.039 --> 00:00:18.920
They get on the skateboard and like trying to do a kickflip.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.780
They don't just like the skateboarding because it's exciting, they like it because they enjoy

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:25.640
the challenge.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:29.719
After skateboarding, they might want to learn something new, like playing guitar, a new

00:00:29.719 --> 00:00:31.640
language or roll blocks.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:34.200
For others, good events are about people.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.920
Being with people who love us make us feel safe and like we belong.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:42.200
No matter why we like something, the more we do these good things, the more they become

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.439
part of who we are.

